sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scenario
    participant W as Shared evidence writer
    participant K as Keepalive loop
    Note over S,K: Permitted schedule, illustrative times, not a native measurement
    K->>W: Previous capture finishes and releases writer
    Note over K: Sleep 20 after completion
    S->>W: Start Allow read with timeout 30
    Note over W: Lock spans dispatch and validation
    Note over S: OCR reuses a VNC connection while live, lock time is not idle time
    K->>W: Sleep ends, request one capture
    W-->>K: Refuse contention, no dispatch or ordinal
    Note over W,K: Sticky unavailable latch, loop exits
    W-->>S: Existing read may finish clean
    S->>W: Next scenario operation
    W-->>S: Refuse, earlier failure remains
    Note over S,K: Reverse overlap also refuses scenario input during capture or PNG validation
    Note over S,K: Waiting only on the keepalive side leaves that reverse overlap
